        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಕಾರ್ಯಾಚರಣೆ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಾರ್ಯಾಚರಣೆ — kāryācaraṇe — \"a mission; an operation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪ್ರವಾಹದಲ್ಲಿ ರಕ್ಷಣಾ ಕಾರ್ಯಾಚರಣೆ ಎರಡು ದಿನ ನಡೆಯಿತು. pravāhadalli rakṣaṇā kāryācaraṇe eraḍu dina naḍeyitu. The rescue operation in the flood went on for two days."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Used of rescue, police and army work: ರಕ್ಷಣಾ ಕಾರ್ಯಾಚರಣೆ (kāryācaraṇe), a rescue operation. In a flood it brings food and ಔಷಧ, medicine, to people cut off by the water."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಾರ್ಯಾಚರಣೆ (kāryācaraṇe) is borrowed from Sanskrit, a modern compound of kārya, \"a thing to be done, business\" (CDIAL 3078), and ācaraṇa, \"undertaking, performing\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
