              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ದೊಡ್ಡ ಅಲೆಗಳು ದಡಕ್ಕೆ ಅಪ್ಪಳಿಸಿದವು. doḍḍa alegaḷu daḍakke appaḷisidavu. Huge waves crashed against the shore."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ಅಪ್ಪಳಿಸಿತು, appaḷisitu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is hit takes -ಗೆ. Storms, waves and news ಅಪ್ಪಳಿಸು (appaḷisu)."
            }
